OL,3,GNEWSAGrant fund aims to tackle
OL,4,Aloneliness and isolation
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council is offering grants of up to
OL,7,F#35,000 to support community projects
OL,8,Faimed at reducing loneliness and
OL,9,Fimproving wellbeing.
OL,11,FWaverley Borough Council said funding
OL,12,Fof between #3,000 and #35,000 would be
OL,13,Favailable for projects supporting
OL,14,Fvulnerable residents across the
OL,15,Fborough.
OL,17,FA council spokesperson said the funding
OL,18,Fwill be available between April 2027
OL,19,Fand March 2028.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
