OL,3,GNEWSAGrant fund aims to tackle
OL,4,Aloneliness and isolation
OL,5,
OL,6,FKika Mirylees, portfolio holder for
OL,7,Fcommunity services, said: "Our
OL,8,Fvoluntary and community sector plays a
OL,9,Fvital role in supporting residents and
OL,10,Fhelping people access the services,
OL,11,Fadvice and connections they need to
OL,12,Fthrive."
